msgstr "Works under way"

#. module: bf_property_operations_portal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_operations_portal/models/bf_property_request.py:0
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_operations_portal.field_bf_property_request__work_ids
msgid "Travaux à exécuter"
msgstr "Works to do"

#. module: bf_property_operations_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_operations_portal.field_bf_property_request__work_ids
msgid ""
"Une demande peut donner zéro, un ou plusieurs travaux : zéro quand un mot "
"suffit ou qu'elle est refusée, plusieurs quand elle touche à plus d'une "
"chose."
msgstr ""
"A request may give rise to zero, one or several works: zero where a word "
"suffices or where it is refused, several where it touches more than one "
"thing."

#. module: bf_property_operations_portal
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_operations_portal/models/bf_property_request.py:0
msgid ""
"« %(request)s » est hors de l'objet du syndicat (art. 1039 C.c.Q.). Ouvrir "
"un travail dessus ferait exécuter ce que le syndicat vient de refuser de "
"prendre en charge."
msgstr ""
"\"%(request)s\" falls outside the objects of the syndicate (art. 1039 CCQ). "
"Opening a work on it would carry out what the syndicate has just refused to "
"take on."

